     "source": "core_rulebook",
     "page": 235
    },
    "description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">A long-shafted spear, the yari is one of the most common weapons in Rokugan. Between six and eight feet long, its shaft is made of hardwood and topped with a leaf-shaped spearhead. Since it is easy to make, the yari is a customary weapon of ashigaru, but also elite clan samurai such as the Daidoji heavy infantry.</span></p>",
